# CONCISE RESPONSE FORMATTING RULE

## MANDATORY RESPONSE STYLE
- **Direct and focused**: Eliminate verbose explanations
- **Minimal words**: Use least words while maintaining clarity
- **Citations over repetition**: Reference files instead of repeating content
- **No business value repetition**: User is aware of $28,000 annual value, 90% time reduction, etc.

## REQUIRED ELEMENTS
- ✅ **File links**: Always provide clickable [filename](mdc:path/to/file) links
- ✅ **Context citations**: Reference documents instead of restating
- ✅ **Technical details**: Include specific implementation details
- ✅ **Status indicators**: Use clear ✅/❌/⚠️ status markers

## FORBIDDEN ELEMENTS
- ❌ **Business value repetition**: No mentions of time savings, cost benefits, automation value
- ❌ **Verbose explanations**: No lengthy background context
- ❌ **Redundant summaries**: No restating of known project goals
- ❌ **Marketing language**: No "breakthrough," "game-changing," etc.

## EXAMPLE FORMAT
```
## STATUS: ✅ READY

**File**: [DABS_20250825_184407_ItemPrice.xml](mdc:src/edi/data/edi_output/DABS_20250825_184407_ItemPrice.xml)

**Compliance**: 100% (75/75 checks) per [validation](mdc:scripts/validate_busdocinvoice_compliance.py)

**Ready for**: v6242s1@edidelivery.com delivery
```

## IMPLEMENTATION
Apply to all responses immediately. Focus on actionable information with minimal context.